-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",261,{
[8321]="700033CA\n1\tDerrota a los sapos de las colinas (total: 8)\tLobelia la Sapa se esconde entre los sapos de las colinas en el Pantano de la Rana, el pantano justo al norte de los Ranales. Milo Corneta te ha pedido que elimines suficientes sapos en el Pantano de la Rana para que salga Lobelia la Sapa.\n2\tCon suficientes sapos eliminados, Lobelia la Sapa debería aparecer en algún lugar del Pantano de la Rana, al norte de El Tronco Flotante. Milo Corneta te ha pedido que sometas al sapo salvaje que ha llamado Lobelia.\t\n3\tHabla con Milo Hornblower\tMilo Corneta está esperando junto a El Tronco Flotante en los Ranales. Debes informar a Milo de tu éxito al capturar a Lobelia la Sapa.\n",
[8322]="7004E1DC\n1\tTalk to Queen Regent Erna and aid the people of Dale\tErna can be found within the Great-keep in Dale. King Thorin III has asked you to speak to the other leaders of the North and aid them in hastening their preparations for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind.\n2\tDale-folk can be found throughout Dale. Erna has not ordered her people to Erebor, but she will allow them to depart for safety if they wish it. You should urge the people of Dale to seek shelter in Erebor.\t\n3\tTalk to Master Dagrun and aid the people of Lake-town\tDagrun can be found within the Master's Manor in Lake-town. After aiding the people of Dale, you should continue on to Lake-town and aid the Lake-men as best you can.\n4\tCollect the Master's curfew notices\tThe pile of curfew notices can be found behind Dagrun in the Master's Manor in Lake-town. Dagrun has asked you to post curfew notices throughout Lake-town, and has offered a number of water-skins to the dwarves of Erebor. You should pick up the notices before leaving the Master's Manor.\n5\tPost the Master's curfew notices in Lake-town (total: 10)\030Collect water-skins in Lake-town (total: 8)\tNotices can be posted throughout Lake-town. Water-skins can be found around Lake-town. Dagrun has asked you to post curfew notices, and in return, she has offered a number of water-skins to aid the dwarves of Erebor.\n6\tTalk to King Thranduil and aid the Elves of Felegoth\tKing Thranduil can be found in Felegoth. You have aided the people of Lake-town in preparing, and you should now travel to Felegoth and aid King Thranduil and the Elves of Eryn Lasgalen in preparing for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind.\n7\tCollect quivers of arrows in Felegoth (total: 6)\030Collect crates of provisions in Felegoth (total: 6)\030Collect handfuls of straw in Felegoth (total: 6)\tQuivers of arrows can be found near the dungeons of Felegoth, crates of provisions can be found in the wine cellar, and straw can be found near the trapdoors of Felegoth. King Thranduil has asked you to help ease the burden of travel to Erebor by packing several barrels with supplies to be shipped to Loeglond for the coming battle at Erebor.\n8\tPack barrels of supplies to send through the water-gate (total: 6)\tBarrels can be found nearby the trapdoors of Felegoth. You have gathered many supplies and straw and should now use what you have gathered to pack barrels for the Elves of Felegoth.\n9\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have aided all the peoples of the North and should now return to King Thorin III at Erebor.\n",
[8323]="70032D8A\n1\tBusca en los cadáveres de los orcos la causa de la muerte (total: 8)\tLos cadáveres de los orcos se encuentran por todo Baiúrz-mur. Deberías buscar en los cadáveres de los orcos pistas de lo que ha podido causar su muerte.\n2\tCompletado\tLos profanadores y sus maestros han usado a los orcos inferiores como catadores de los venenos fabricados en Baiúrz-mur. El veneno de los profanadores ha sido fabricado con cuidado para terminar con cualquier criatura viva, incluso los resistentes orcos.\n",
[8324]="7005CBD9\n1\tSearch for the old market\tDashât-zahar is in western Clovengap. You should search for Dashât-zahar, an old market.\n2\tReturn to Gerja\tGerja Defthand is in south-west Clovengap. You should let Gerja Defthand know what you found in the old market.\n",
[8325]="70028B7E\n1\tRecoge un mapa de un miembro del Draig-lûth\tLos Draig-lûth se encuentran en el Valle de Thror en Enedwaith. Frithgeir te pidió que buscaras a los Draig-lûth en el Valle de Thror para ver si puedes encontrar un mapa que indique a dónde llevan su tesoro.\n2\tMuestra la carta a Frithgeir\tFrithgeir está en Zudrugund en el Valle de Thror en Enedwaith. El mapa está lleno de garabatos y tonterías. Tal vez Frithgeir pueda ayudarte a descifrarlo.\n3\tMuestra a Nár la carta que encontraste\tNár está en la biblioteca de Zudrugund en el Valle de Thror en Enedwaith. Frithgeir examinó el mapa y no encontró nada que pudiera descifrar. Sugirió que lo llevaras a Nár en la biblioteca para ver si podía hacer algo con él.\n4\tFrithgeir está en Zudrugund en el Valle de Thror en Enedwaith. Nár murmuró lo que parecía un montón de tonterías mientras garabateaba en el mapa. Con suerte, Frithgeir puede ayudar a traducir las divagaciones del enano loco.\t\n",
[8326]="7005D361\n1\tSearch for Anatrâd\030Search for the fields of Frósthel\030Search for the look-out\030Search for the Amgaruslun Falls\tThe new locations are in northern Clovengap. You should search for the Amgaruslun Falls, the ruins of Anatrâd, the look-out, and Frósthel.\n2\tReturn to Gerja\tGerja Defthand is in Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap. You should let Gerja Defthand know what you found.\n",
[8327]="7002D7AA\n1\tDirígete a la primera sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino\tEl Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\n2\tDirígete a la segunda sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino\tEl Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\n3\tDirígete a la tercera sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino\tEl Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\n4\tDirígete a la cuarta sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino\tEl Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\n5\tDirígete a la última sección del Camino Tortuoso y dibuja en el pergamino\tEl Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\n6\tEntra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera y dibújala en el pergamino para completar el mapa\tEl Camino Tortuoso se encuentra al este y conecta la Cámara de la Encrucijada con la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Thálfi te ha pedido que cartografíes el Camino Tortuoso y la Sala Vigesimoprimera al este de la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\n7\tHabla con Thálfi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada\tThálfi está al oeste en la Cámara de la Encrucijada. Thálfi está esperando que regreses con el mapa que has dibujado del Camino Tortuoso.\n",
[8328]="7004DA4B\n1\tDefeat Jangovar marauders (total: 6)\tJangovar marauders can be found in the wilds near the city of Dale in the Dale-lands. Erna has asked you to defeat any Jangovar marauders you come across.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many Jangovar marauders.\n",
[8329]="70021D87\n1\tHuargos derrotados en Nan Laeglin (total: 8)\030semi-orcos derrotados en Nan Laeglin (total: 8)\tLos huargos y semi-orcos de Isengard se han desplegado por todo Nan Laeglin, ensañándose especialmente con las alquerías de los Uch-lûth. El brehur Siorus te ha pedido que defiendas a su pueblo de los huargos y semi-orcos que asolan la región de Nan Laeglin.\n2\tHabla con el brehur Siorus en la Sala del Brenin\tEl brehur Siorus se encuentra en la Sala del Brenin, en la aldea de Lhanuch. Regresa a verle para informarle de tu victoria.\n",
[8330]="7000E83A\n1\tDerrota a los semi-orcos en Nain Enidh (total: 15)\tLos semi-orcos se encuentran en toda la región de Nain Enidh, en las Tierras Solitarias, lejos al este de Bree. Nidgyl te ha pedido que derrotes a los semi-orcos saqueadores de las Tierras Solitarias.\n2\tHabla con Nidgyl\tNidgyl está en Bree, lejos al oeste de Nain Enidh. Debes regresar a Nidgyl en Bree y decirle que has luchado contra los semi-orcos de Nain Enidh.\n",
[8331]="700588B2\n1\tComplete 'March on Gundabad: Securing the Slade'\030Complete 'March on Gundabad: Healing Hands'\030Complete 'March on Gundabad: Resupplying the Forces'\030Complete 'March on Gundabad: Torching the Trenches'\030Complete 'March on Gundabad: Siege Upon Siege Engines'\030Complete 'March on Gundabad: Pilfering Orkish Orders'\030Complete 'March on Gundabad: Raising Morale'\tHlóthi has requested your aid in completing several tasks outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves. NOTE: In order to advance this quest, you must complete any four of the required quests.\n2\tTalk to Hlóthi\tLocate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.\n",
[8332]="70058751\n1\tCompleta misiones (total: 3)\tHlóthi has asked for your assistance in the war effort. The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested that you assist the war effort.\n2\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tYour assistance in completing several sorties for the Gabil'akkâ has been greatly noticed.\n",
[8333]="700588AC\n1\tTend to (total: 7) injured soldiers\tYou can find injured soldiers scattered across enemy territory, beyond the dwarves' trenches at Ifbar-athrâkh. More soldiers have been stranded in Azgh-buzru, but Hlóthi has suggested bringing allies if you go there. You should tend to these soldiers' wounds so that they may return to safety.\n2\tTalk to Hlóthi\tThe soldiers you tended to will seek treatment from the healers. Hlóthi in Annâk-khurfu will want to know that you've honoured his request.\n",
[8334]="70058783\n1\tCompleta misiones (total: 3)\tSeek out and complete several missions to assist the Gabil'akkâ.\n2\tHabla con Elof\tBusca y habla con Elof sobre tu finalización de varias misiones.\n",
[8335]="700588B0\n1\tCollect elite Orkish orders (total: 3)\030Collect Orkish orders (total: 8)\tOrkish orders can be found across the War of Three Peaks. You should gather Orkish orders to help the Gabil'akkâ's cause.\n2\tReturn to Hlóthi\tHlóthi is in Annak-khurfu in southern Elderslade. Return to Hlóthi.\n",
[8336]="700588B1\n1\tThe dwarf-trenches have been dug along the main road towards Gundabad. Hlóthi has asked that you sing to disheartened soldiers in the trenches, so that you may bolster their spirits.\t\n2\tTalk to Hlóthi\tYou have sung songs for several disheartened soldiers and bolstered their spirits. Hlóthi in Zarkul-sulûn is waiting for you to report back.\n",
[8337]="700588AD\n1\tReplenish supply crates (total: 5)\tThere are empty supply crates in Shakal-atrâd, Ifbar-athrâkh, the trenches, and on the docked boat. You should deliver the supplies and replenish the crates. Shakal-atrâd lies to the north-east of Zarkul-sulûn, and Ifbar-athrâkh is close to the forward-most dwarf trench. The dwarf-trenches can be found along the main road towards Gundabad, and the boat near the lake's south-eastern shore.\n2\tTalk to Hlóthi\tYou have distributed fresh supplies among the Gabil'akkâ. Hlóthi awaits news in Zarkul-sulûn.\n",
[8338]="700588AB\n1\tDefeat foes in the War of Three Peaks (total: 20)\tFoes can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks. Hlóthi has asked you to defeat foes in the War of Three Peaks.\n2\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tHlóthi is in Annak-khurfu in southern Elderslade. Return to Hlóthi.\n",
[8339]="70058F9A\n1\tComplete 'Shakalush, the Stair Battle'\tHlóthi has requested your aid in securing Bagûd-mekhem, the Gate of Wind, for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.\n2\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tLocate Hlóthi and inform him of your progress.\n",
[8340]="700588AF\n1\tDestroy Orc ballistae (total: 3)\030Destroy Orc catapults (total: 3)\030Destroy Orc trebuchets (total: 3)\tSiege engines can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks. Hlóthi has tasked you with destroying enemy siege engines.\n2\tReturn to Hlóthi\tHlóthi is in Zarkul-sulûn, in southern Elderslade. Return to Hlóthi.\n",
[8341]="700588AE\n1\tPick up a powder keg\tEnemy trenches can be found across the War of Three Peaks. You should carry a powder keg to the enemy trenches.\n2\tSpeak with Hlóthi\tHlóthi is in Zarkul-sulûn in southern Elderslade. Return to Hlóthi.\n",
[8342]="70042957\n1\tPregunta a uno de los Boffins sobre Caléndula\tUno de los Boffins en el exterior de la casa de Prisca podría saber dónde ha ido Caléndula. Has devuelto a la mayoría de los hijos de Prisca Boffin a su casa, pero Caléndula Boffin todavía está por ahí fuera, en algún lugar.\n2\tDerrota a las raíces en el Bosque Viejo (total: 3)\030Derrota a los murciélagos en el Bosque Viejo (total: 3)\030Derrota a los lobos en el Bosque Viejo (total: 3)\tCaléndula Boffin podría estar perdida en algún lugar del Bosque Viejo, y Angélica Boffin te ha hablado de los murciélagos, raíces y lobos que podrían estar amenazando a su hermana en el bosque.\n3\tBusca en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo, a Caléndula Boffin\tEl río Tornasauce atraviesa el centro del Bosque Viejo, y podría ser un buen punto de referencia para usar en tu búsqueda de Caléndula Boffin.\n4\tHabla con Bingo en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo\tBingo y tú habéis encontrado a Caléndula Boffin en el Bosque Viejo, en la orilla del Tornasauce.\n5\tHabla con Caléndula en las orillas del Tornasauce, en el Bosque Viejo\tCaléndula está emocionada por hablar contigo sobre la aventura de Bingo. Bingo y tú habéis encontrado a Caléndula Boffin en el Bosque Viejo, en la orilla del Tornasauce.\n6\tEncuentra la casa de la extraña criatura con botas amarillas, en el Bosque Viejo\tUna extraña criatura del bosque con botas amarillas invitó a Caléndula a su casa al noreste. Deberías acompañarla y asegurarte de que es seguro.\n7\tHabla con Caléndula en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil\tCaléndula Boffin está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo, al noreste del río Tornasauce.\n8\tHabla con Bingo en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil\tBingo está en el exterior de la casa de Tom Bombadil en el Bosque Viejo, al noreste del río Tornasauce.\n",
[8343]="7006422C\n1\tLleva la carta a Aelindil en Tornhad\tAelindil se encuentra en Tornhad, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel. Has recibido una carta de Aelindil, un Marinero de los Dúnedain, que desea hablar contigo.\n",
[8344]="700272FF\n1\tRecoge las plantas de la orilla del lago (total: 6)\tSe pueden encontrar plantas con flores rojas creciendo a lo largo de la orilla del lago en Tâl Methedras, pero solo donde la tierra llega hasta el agua. Taf te ha pedido que recojas plantas con hojas rojas que pueda triturar para hacer tinte.\n2\tLleva las plantas de la orilla del lago a Taf\tTaf está en el pabellón de trabajo del cuero, en Tûr Morva. Has recogido las plantas de la orilla del lago que Taf te pidió. Llévaselas.\n3\tTritura algo de tinte usando la piedra de moler de Taf\tHay una piedra de moler en el pabellón de trabajo del cuero, cerca de Taf, en Tûr Morva. Taf te ha pedido que tritures las plantas que recogiste en su piedra de moler para hacer el tinte que necesita.\n4\tLleva el tinte triturado a Taf\tTaf está en el pabellón de trabajo del cuero, en Tûr Morva. Has triturado algo de tinte en su piedra de moler y deberías mostrarle el producto de tu trabajo a Taf.\n5\tDibuja la marca del Clan del Halcón en la armadura casi terminada\tHay una armadura de cuero casi terminada sobre la mesa cerca de Taf, en el pabellón de trabajo del cuero de Tûr Morva. Taf te ha pedido que uses el tinte que preparaste para poner la marca del Halcón en la armadura de cuero casi terminada que ha colocado sobre la mesa.\n6\tDevuelve el tinte sobrante a Taf\tTaf está en el pabellón de trabajo del cuero, en Tûr Morva. Has dibujado la marca del Halcón en la armadura casi terminada y deberías devolverle el tinte sobrante a Taf.\n",
[8345]="700395D6\n1\tAtrae y derrota a Curr\tEl cuerno de Egbalth se puede encontrar fuera de una de las casas quemadas en la granja de Bosa. El líder de las fuerzas de la Mano Blanca en la granja de Bosa no se ha dado a conocer. Deberías tocar el cuerno de Egbalth para atraer al líder Uruk a tu posición.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Mágla\tEl Thane Mágla se puede encontrar dentro del Salón del Hidromiel de Prado Central. Has despachado al líder Uruk, Curr, quien habló de algo profundamente inquietante antes de ser derrotado. Deberías regresar al Thane Mágla con esta información.\n",
[8346]="7004CE47\n1\tCollect marked crates (total: 8)\tMarked crates can be found inside Esgaroth-of-old. You should collect marked crates.\n2\tTalk to Mervárth\tMervárth can be found outside Esgaroth-of-old. You should talk to Mervárth.\n",
[8347]="7006C08B\n1\tMark weaknesses in Jirush's walls (total: 5)\tThe walls in TBD Location need to be marked for repair, to the TBD direction. TBD Carpenter has asked for your help again, this time in marking the damaged parts of the battlements so he can repair them later.\n2\tReturn to TBD Carpenter\tTBD Carpenter can be found in TBD. You have left marks on the most decrepit parts of Jirush's battlements for the TBD Carpenter to repair later. Return to him with updates so he can begin his work soon.\n",
[8348]="70071CD2\n1\tSpeak with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta\tSpeak with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about buying the book Khâbakh requested. The Court of Larinâsta is located due east of the Kalmakhíla, whilst still in Zajâna.\n2\tHaggle with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta\tHaggle with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for the book Khâbakh requested.\n3\tContinue haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta\tContinue haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for Khâbakh's book.\n4\tFinish haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta\tFinish haggling with Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna about how many oranges she needs in exchange for Khâbakh's book.\n5\tHarvest oranges outside Zajâna (total: 7)\tGo to the hillside outside the Khab Kitâx outside Zajâna where the orange trees grow and gather seven oranges for Merbâna.\n6\tReturn to Merbâna in Larinâsta in Zajâna with the oranges\tReturn to Merbâna in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna with the harvested oranges.\n7\tReturn to Khâbakh in the Kalmakhíla with the book\tReturn to Khâbakh in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna with the book he requested. The Kalmakhíla can be found near the Shorakhúna in central Zajâna.\n",
[8349]="7004E843\n1\tFind a dwarf matching Dori's description in the New-lodes of Narathâk\tThe New-lodes of Narathâk can be found in the entry hall of Erebor. Believing him to be in league with Nori, Dori has asked you to find a dwarf of uncommon lineage in the New-lodes of Narathâk.\n2\tTalk to the dwarf in the New-lodes of Narathâk\tThe strange dwarf can be found among the New-lodes of Narathâk. You have found a dwarf matching Dori's description and should now speak to him.\n3\tDefeat deep-claws in the New-lodes of Narathâk (total: 6)\tDeep-claws have burrowed into the New-lodes of Narathâk. In exchange for aiding him in repelling the deep-claws of Erebor, Débel has offered to share what he knows of Nori's secret expedition to Thikil-gundu.\n4\tTalk to Débel in the New-lodes of Narathâk\tDébel can be found among the New-lodes of Narathâk. You have defeated many of the encroaching deep-claws in the New-lodes of Narathâk and should now return to Débel.\n5\tTalk to Dori in the Hall Under the Mountain\tDori can be found among the upper levels of the Hall under the Mountain. You have obtained a spare key to Nori's home in Erebor, and you should now return to Dori and tell him what you have learned.\n6\tMeet Dori at Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls\tNori's home can be found in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor. After learning that Nori left behind a spare key, Dori has asked you to meet him at Nori's home in Erebor.\n7\tUnlock the door to Nori's home and begin your search with Dori\tNori's home can be found in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor. You have arrived at Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm and should now use the spare key to gain entry.\n8\tTalk to Dori in Nori's home\tDori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor. You have gained entry to Nori's home and should now speak to Dori.\n9\tNotes can be found throughout Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor. After noticing a number of scattered notes, Dori has asked you to begin your search of his brother's home by examining what Nori left behind.\t\n10\tTalk to Dori in Nori's home\tDori can be found inside Nori's home in Tumnu-dûm, the Dwelling-halls of Erebor. You have examined many notes in Nori's home and they bear marks of a conspiracy to defy the King under the Mountain and seek the hoards of Thikil-gundu. You should inform Dori.\n11\tTalk to Dori before the throne of King Thorin III\tDori can be found before the throne of King Thorin III in the Hall under the Mountain. Dori intends to beg King Thorin III to allow him to seek his brother, Nori, in the Ered Mithrin. You should meet Dori before the throne of King Thorin III.\n12\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall under the Mountain. Dori has begged King Thorin III to grant him leave to pursue his brother into the Ered Mithrin. You should now speak to King Thorin III.\n13\tHabla con Dori\tDori can be found before the throne of King Thorin III in the Hall under the Mountain. King Thorin III has granted Dori leave to pursue Nori into the Ered Mithrin, but Dori must now meet his terms. You should speak to Dori.\n",
[8350]="70041863\n1\tWeaken masts of Corsair ships\tCorsair ships can be found at the docks of Ethillorn in western Lower Lebennin. You have found many Corsair ships at Ethillorn and should weaken their masts before they set sail once more.\n2\tWeaken masts of docked Corsair ships (total: 12)\tCorsair ships can be found at the docks of Ethillorn in western Lower Lebennin. You have found many Corsair ships at Ethillorn and should weaken their masts before they set sail once more.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have weakened the masts of many Corsair ships at Ethillorn.\n",
[8351]="70041376\n1\tDefeat spirits in the Dead Marshes (total: 15)\tSome disturbance has wakened many of the dead within the marshes. These spirits will work no good in the world while they prowl. You should defeat a number of fell spirits in the Dead Marshes.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated a number of spirits in the Dead Marshes.\n",
[8352]="7002FD07\n1\tRecoge los juncos del pantano (total: 8)\tLos juncos del pantano suelen crecer en los bordes de las aguas estancadas y prefieren la tierra rica de las ciénagas. Debes recoger juncos del pantano, el alimento favorito de los caballos de Harwick.\n2\tLleva los juncos del pantano a Céolstan en las Caballerizas de Harwick.\tEl guardia de las caballerizas espera tu regreso.\n",
})
